                                                            09/06/2026 5:00 PM<br/>                                                                                        ID:&nbsp;298626298                                                 </td>
                                <td class='cV noBorderBot'>I would add more scenario variety and include additional topics such as phishing emails, social media safety, and password security. More animations, sound effects, and rewards for completing levels could make the game even more engaging. It would also be helpful to include a progress tracker and a  screen at the end showing key lessons learned and areas for improvement.</td>
